: [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Run a Task", "originalText": "Run a Task", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-skill", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2192.5, "width": 663.0, "height": 20.3125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 1047365465, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1685003032, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Skill haipipe-task-run (new) · agent haipipe-task-orchestrator-agent", "originalText": "Skill haipipe-task-run (new) · agent haipipe-task-orchestrator-agent", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-prompt", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2237.5, "width": 441.0, "height": 43.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 559818483, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 655774951, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Prompt  [Copy]\n/haipipe-task: run <job>/<task>/runs/<run>.sh", "originalText": "Prompt  [Copy]\n/haipipe-task: run <job>/<task>/runs/<run>.sh", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-list", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2337.5, "width": 283.5, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 913026584, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 614680269, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Runs of the picked Question\nr01_<run>   complete   ⧉\nr11_<run>   complete   ⧉\nr01_<run>   running    ⧉", "originalText": "Runs of the picked Question\nr01_<run>   complete   ⧉\nr11_<run>   complete   ⧉\nr01_<run>   running    ⧉", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-note", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2500.0, "width": 392.0, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 199678071, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1019347239, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Status lives here, never in the table.\nPicking a Question row narrows the list.\nCopy hands the prompt to a session;\nnothing here starts a run.", "originalText": "Status lives here, never in the table.\nPicking a Question row narrows the list.\nCopy hands the prompt to a session;\nnothing here starts a run.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_ws-notes", "type": "text", "x": 1480.0, "y": 2967.5, "width": 2576.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 1033243451, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1488001700, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A row is Logic │ Task Work │ Report, as Insight's partition table. Task Work writes each level once and folds the Runs; a Run, a Task Page, the report and a drawing open in one pop-out with an own-tab link. No status in the table.", "originalText": "A row is Logic │ Task Work │ Report, as Insight's partition table. Task Work writes each level once and folds the Runs; a Run, a Task Page, the report and a drawing open in one pop-out with an own-tab link. No status in the table.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_p3-title", "type": "text", "x": 1450.0, "y": 3205.0, "width": 764.4000000000001, "height": 43.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 423569543, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 601790483, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 · Where things live: the Block folder", "originalText": "3 · Where things live: the Block folder", "fontSize": 35, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_tree-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1450.0, "y": 3275.0, "width": 6000.0, "height": 625.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1378080462, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 791715868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_tree", "type": "text", "x": 1490.0, "y": 3310.0, "width": 1440.0, "height": 500.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 621513632, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1470514808, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "tasks/bNN_<block>/\n├── board.md                      spine · close · Questions register · Related resources\n├── reports/qNN_<topic>/           one report Page per Question (Opening → Content)\n│   ├── qNN_<topic>.md · page.toml\n│   └── runs/                      the Page's own runs (CHECK)\n├── studio/question-map.excalidraw generated by question_map.py (Scope › RoadMap Draw)\n├── studio/<name>.excalidraw       freeform Block drawings (Scope › RoadMap Draw)\n└── jNN_<job>/\n    ├── src/                        the Job's shared workers (CODE_REVIEW.md beside them)\n    └── tNN_<task>/\n        ├── tNN_<task>.md           the Task Page\n        ├── workflow/plan.yaml · report.yaml   the Task's plan and its Run report\n        ├── scripts/ · CODE_REVIEW.md   the Task's code and its review\n        ├── scripts/config/rNN_<run>.yaml\n        ├── runs/rNN_<run>.sh        the Ticket: the only writer of its Result\n        └── results/rNN_<run>/       under $OUTPUT_ROOT: receipt · tables · fig_*.png · drawings", "originalText": "tasks/bNN_<block>/\n├── board.md                      spine · close · Questions register · Related resources\n├── reports/qNN_<topic>/           one report Page per Question (Opening → Content)\n│   ├── qNN_<topic>.md · page.toml\n│   └── runs/                      the Page's own runs (CHECK)\n├── studio/question-map.excalidraw generated by question_map.py (Scope › RoadMap Draw)\n├── studio/<name>.excalidraw       freeform Block drawings (Scope › RoadMap Draw)\n└── jNN_<job>/\n    ├── src/                        the Job's shared workers (CODE_REVIEW.md beside them)\n    └── tNN_<task>/\n        ├── tNN_<task>.md           the Task Page\n        ├── workflow/plan.yaml · report.yaml   the Task's plan and its Run report\n        ├── scripts/ · CODE_REVIEW.md   the Task's code and its review\n        ├── scripts/config/rNN_<run>.yaml\n        ├── runs/rNN_<run>.sh        the Ticket: the only writer of its Result\n        └── results/rNN_<run>/       under $OUTPUT_ROOT: receipt · tables · fig_*.png · drawings", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_tree-notes", "type": "text", "x": 1490.0, "y": 3930.0, "width": 2261.0, "height": 26.5625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 1991088487, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1406765107, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791081053683, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Guide's Method and Related Paper live with the skill (haipipe-workbench-task/ref/), the same for every Block. Heavy Run output goes to _WorkSpace/ProjectResult/; the Result keeps heavy.yaml.", "originalText": "Guide's Method and Related Paper live with the skill (haipipe-workbench-task/ref/), the same for every Block. Heavy Run output goes to _WorkSpace/ProjectResult/; the Result keeps heavy.yaml.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_frame-skills", "type": "frame", "x": 1400.0, "y": 497.5, "width": 6100.0, "height": 1164.6875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "stroke